-- two atoms in one orbit of the configured molecule: related by an automorphism that preserves every
-- arrangement. These are the positions a spectrum reports in a chiral medium.
StOrbit : (C : Stereo) → mol-atoms (st-mol C) → mol-atoms (st-mol C) → Type 0
StOrbit C x y = (a : StAuto C) × (auto-fun (st-mol C) (fst a) x ≡ y)
